<title>POLAND: Polisa to end OTC trade on March 21.</title>
<headline>Polisa to end OTC trade on March 21.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurance firm Polisa SA will trade on the regulated over-the-counter market for the last time on March 21, the president of the firm which runs the OTC market Centralna Tabela Ofert (CeTO) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Polisa earlier applied to the Warsaw bourse to list the 4.27 million shares, currently listed on the OTC, on the bourse's main market.</p>
<p>Currently there are 4.1 million Polisa shares trading on the bourse. Polisa has a total of 10.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
